  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632338256893117418 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632338256825943018&sectionId=632338256893117418)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNCmsFqTTt_text","label":"ggNCmsFqTTt_text","default":"<p>Summer vacations are filled with unforgettable adventures, breathtaking views, and quality time with the people who matter most. While it's easy to bring home postcards, magnets, or keychains, the most meaningful souvenirs are the memories you create along the way. A custom Memobrick photo mosaic lets you transform your favorite vacation photo into a one-of-a-kind keepsake, giving you a fun building experience and a lasting reminder of your summer adventures.</p><p>In this guide, we'll explore why personalized vacation souvenirs are more meaningful than traditional keepsakes and how you can preserve your favorite travel memories in a creative way.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggu-kMSzBXe_text","label":"ggu-kMSzBXe_text","default":"<p>Why Personalized Vacation Souvenirs Mean More</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggG80MgXBzN_text","label":"ggG80MgXBzN_text","default":"<p>Every vacation tells a story, from relaxing beach days and scenic road trips to exciting family adventures. While traditional souvenirs may remind you of where you traveled, personalized keepsakes capture the moments that made the trip unforgettable. A favorite photo from your journey becomes more than just an image—it becomes a lasting reminder of the laughter, experiences, and memories shared along the way.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZV3yJl0yN_text","label":"ggZV3yJl0yN_text","default":"<p><strong>Why Choose Memobrick as Your Summer Vacation Souvenir?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiR_yoestr_viewMoreText","label":"ggiR_yoestr_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiR_yoestr_viewLessText","label":"ggiR_yoestr_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzUwcNlE9W_text","label":"ggzUwcNlE9W_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_label","label":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out of stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_unavailableLabel","label":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_successMessage","label":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_errorMessage","label":"ggmqz_VR5Vy_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"gghehI-L1yQ_text","label":"gghehI-L1yQ_text","default":"<p><strong>1. Turn Your Favorite Vacation Photo Into a Custom Keepsake</strong></p><p>Transform a special travel photo into a personalized brick mosaic that celebrates your favorite summer adventure.</p><p><strong>2. Relive Your Favorite Memories While Building</strong></p><p>Enjoy a fun DIY building experience that lets you recreate your vacation one piece at a time.</p><p><strong>3. A Unique Piece of Home Décor</strong></p><p>Display your finished Memobrick in your home or office as a daily reminder of unforgettable summer memories.</p><p><strong>4. A Souvenir That Lasts for Years</strong></p><p>Unlike postcards, magnets, or keychains, a custom Memobrick becomes a meaningful keepsake you'll proudly display long after your vacation ends.</p><p><strong>Perfect Summer Vacation Photos to Turn Into a Memobrick</strong></p><ul><li>Family beach vacations</li><li>National park adventures</li><li>Road trips</li><li>Camping weekends</li><li>Honeymoons</li><li>Cruise vacations</li><li>Theme park memories</li><li>Sunset photos</li><li>Mountain hikes</li><li>Group travel with friends</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY9MYFYfq0_text","label":"ggY9MYFYfq0_text","default":"<p>The best souvenirs aren't measured by their price—they're defined by the memories they represent. Instead of bringing home something that ends up in a drawer, turn your favorite summer vacation photo into a personalized keepsake you'll enjoy for years to come. With Memobrick, every piece helps recreate the moments, adventures, and experiences that made your trip truly unforgettable.</p>"}],
